OL,3,ASchool headscarf ban sparks rare
OL,4,Aprotests in Azerbaijan and row with
OL,5,ATurkey
OL,6,
OL,7,F"You are telling me, I can't come to
OL,8,Fschool?" says a teenage girl in a navy
OL,9,Fblue Islamic headscarf, captured on
OL,10,Fvideo challenging a staff member at the
OL,11,Fentrance to her school.
OL,13,FThe footage has been shared widely on
OL,14,Fsocial media, and shows a group of
OL,15,Fgirls in hijabs standing behind her
OL,16,Fapplauding as she continues: "Why
OL,17,Fshould I have to give up my religion?"
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
