OL,3,ASchool headscarf ban sparks rare
OL,4,Aprotests in Azerbaijan and row with
OL,5,ATurkey
OL,6,
OL,7,FLast Monday the education ministry in
OL,8,FAzerbaijan began enforcing new uniform
OL,9,Frules, turning away female pupils
OL,10,Fwearing hijabs. Protests began outside
OL,11,Fstate schools in the capital, Baku, and
OL,12,Fin several southern districts including
OL,13,FMasally and Jalilabad.
OL,15,FProtests are rare in this oil- and
OL,16,Fgas-producing country of 10.5 million
OL,17,Fpeople.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
